You are analyzing hierarchical software requirements for cross level traceability.
Determine whether a traceability link exists between a High-Level Requirement (HLR) and a Low-Level Requirement (LLR).
A link exists if the LLR implements, refines, or decomposes the HLR.
High-Level Requirement:
  Summary: DMN Boxed Expression editor - Enhancements
  Description: All the tasks related to features that will improve boxed expression editor usability and that will add new functionalities
Low-Level Requirement:
  Summary: Apply thresholds to code coverage quality check
  Description: Modify and improve test cases in order to successfully apply the following thresholds in 
{code:java}
 "coverageThreshold": {
 "global": {
 "branches": 80,
 "functions": 80,
 "lines": 80,
 "statements": -10
 }
 }
{code}
Return only:
{"is_linked": true}
or
{"is_linked": false}
No additional text.
